        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that starts a streaming recognizer with language and punctuation settings using a concrete external provider. The script should be identifiable with the provider. I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that offers streaming recognition with language and punctuation settings. </thinking>\n",
