      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file \"stream_chunks.py\" that streams audio chunks from an async source using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific provider. For this task, I will use the AWS Polly service, which is a text-to-speech service that turns text into lifelike speech using deep learning. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
